    "Folders that tools can rebuild or download again, such as node_modules, Pods, or local build output — matched by name, or verified by the sibling project files that produced them (Cargo's target, .venv, Unity's Library). Excluded entries stay untouched. Rebuilds and re-downloads take time." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folders that tools can rebuild or download again, such as node_modules, Pods, or local build output — matched by name, or verified by the sibling project files that produced them (Cargo's target, .venv, Unity's Library). Excluded entries stay untouched. Rebuilds and re-downloads take time."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Папки, которые инструменты могут собрать или загрузить заново: node_modules, Pods или локальные результаты сборки — по имени или по рядом лежащим файлам проекта, которые их создают (target у Cargo, .venv, Library Unity). Исключённые объекты не изменяются. Пересборка и повторная загрузка занимают время."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward" : {
