    "Some of these are protected by macOS against every app: other applications' app data and protected libraries. No dialog is offered for reading them; to measure these folders too, allow DiskUnbloat under Full Disk Access. Unmeasured folders still appear with their known size." : {
      "extractionState" : "translated",
