          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The versioned install tree of the Homebrew package manager: one folder per package per installed version. Deleting it uninstalls your packages — use `brew uninstall` and `brew autoremove` instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The versioned install tree of the Homebrew package manager: one folder per package per installed version. Deleting it uninstalls your packages — use `brew uninstall` and `brew autoremove` instead."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Дерево установок пакетного менеджера Homebrew: по папке на каждый пакет и установленную версию. Удаление — то же, что удаление ваших пакетов; пользуйтесь `brew uninstall` и `brew autoremove`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Wine runtime and Game Porting Toolkit libraries Whisky downloaded to run Windows games. Removing them breaks Windows apps until Whisky re-downloads the runtime; your bottles live in the app's container, not here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Wine runtime and Game Porting Toolkit libraries Whisky downloaded to run Windows games. Removing them breaks Windows apps until Whisky re-downloads the runtime; your bottles live in the app's container, not here."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Рантайм Wine и библиотеки Game Porting Toolkit, которые Whisky скачал для запуска Windows-игр. Удаление ломает Windows-приложения до повторной загрузки рантайма; ваши бутылки лежат в контейнере приложения, не здесь."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These files exceed your size threshold. Size does not establish that they are unused." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These files exceed your size threshold. Size does not establish that they are unused."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти файлы превышают заданный размер. Это не означает, что они не используются."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These folders, and packages unless their contents are inspected, are sized in one fast pass and shown as one tile; their files aren’t listed. Symbolic links aren’t followed; cloud files aren’t downloaded. Changes apply to the next scan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These folders, and packages unless their contents are inspected, are sized in one fast pass and shown as one tile; their files aren’t listed. Symbolic links aren’t followed; cloud files aren’t downloaded. Changes apply to the next scan."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти папки, а также пакеты, если их содержимое не просматривается, измеряются за один быстрый проход и показываются одной плиткой; их файлы не перечисляются. Символические ссылки не обходятся; облачные файлы не загружаются. Изменения применяются к следующему сканированию."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These locations weren’t fully read. Their complete sizes are unknown; the map still includes known bytes. Showing up to 500 issues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These locations weren’t fully read. Their complete sizes are unknown; the map still includes known bytes. Showing up to 500 issues."
